&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This is just the beginning of what we can accomplish together. Join us at Konovo and help shape the future of healthcare technology!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
